# Bounce sshd for the UBC VPN exit — ported from projects/vpn_bounce
# (load/sshd_config). This sshd shares the container's netns with openconnect, so
# an `ssh -W %h:%p` / `ProxyJump` through it egresses via the UBC tunnel. That is
# the entire job — forwarding, not interactive shells — so AllowTcpForwarding is
# the load-bearing line. Key-only: the sole authorized key is the bounce keypair
# the vpn service injects (see ssh_server); no passwords on a published port.
AuthorizedKeysFile	.ssh/authorized_keys

PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no

AllowTcpForwarding yes
GatewayPorts no
X11Forwarding no

Subsystem	sftp	internal-sftp
